{"id":"21fb1aba77483012","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-formal-measure-quarter-large.md","title":"形式测度下界迫使四分之一函数复杂","display":"lem-formal-measure-quarter-large — 形式测度下界迫使四分之一函数复杂","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-formal-measure-quarter-large","aliases":["28-lem-formal-measure-quarter-large"],"display":"lem-formal-measure-quarter-large — 形式测度下界迫使四分之一函数复杂","depends_on":["[[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]"],"source_book_location":"Lemma 23.6","source_printed_pages":"502–503","source_pdf_pages":"528–529","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-formal-measure-quarter-large"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-formal-measure-quarter-large</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-formal-measure-quarter-large — 形式测度下界迫使四分之一函数复杂"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc32a2c3b871a820\" href=\"?note=cc32a2c3b871a820\" title=\"28-df-formal-complexity-measure\">28-df-formal-complexity-measure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Lemma 23.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"502–503"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"528–529"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_n=\\{g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal B_n=\\{g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)\">\\(\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)\\)</span>，其定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc32a2c3b871a820\" href=\"?note=cc32a2c3b871a820\" title=\"28-df-formal-complexity-measure\">28-df-formal-complexity-measure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal B_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal B_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(S\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(f)\\ge S\">\\(\\mu(f)\\ge S\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 在全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{2^n}\">\\(2^{2^n}\\)</span> 个布尔函数中均匀抽样；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=f\\oplus g\">\\(h=f\\oplus g\\)</span>，XOR 逐点取模二和。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{|\\{g\\in\\mathcal B_n:\\mu(g)\\ge S/4\\}|}{2^{2^n}}\\ge\\frac14.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{|\\{g\\in\\mathcal B_n:\\mu(g)\\ge S/4\\}|}{2^{2^n}}\\ge\\frac14.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：f=(¬h∧g)∨(h∧¬g)，所以 μ(f)≤μ(¬h)+μ(g)+μ(h)+μ(¬g)。g,h,¬g,¬h 的边际分布都均匀（不要求相互独立）。若高测度函数比例小于 1/4，四个低测度事件由并集界同时发生的概率为正，推出 μ(f)&lt;S，矛盾。注意不能误用未经假设的 μ(¬g)=μ(g)。已复核原书证明。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Lemma 23.6；印刷页 502–503；PDF 页 528–529。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-formal-complexity-measure","status":"resolved","id":"cc32a2c3b871a820","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-formal-complexity-measure","status":"resolved","id":"cc32a2c3b871a820","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\mathcal B_n=\\{g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}$，$\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，假定 $\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)$，其定义见 [[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]。$f\\in\\mathcal B_n$，$S\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}$，$\\mu(f)\\ge S$。$g$ 在全部 $2^{2^n}$ 个布尔函数中均匀抽样；$h=f\\oplus g$，XOR 逐点取模二和。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_n=\\{g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathcal B_n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(f)\\ge S","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"2^{2^n}","display":false},{"tex":"h=f\\oplus g","display":false},{"tex":"\\frac{|\\{g\\in\\mathcal B_n:\\mu(g)\\ge S/4\\}|}{2^{2^n}}\\ge\\frac14.","display":true}],"bytes":1676,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-412","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]、[[28-thm-formal-measure-formula-bound]]、[[28-lem-formal-measure-quarter-large]]、[[28-thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere]]、[[28-df-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-promise-ma]]、[[28-df-promise-circuit-size]]、[[28-thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound]]、[[28-prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness]]、[[28-ex-singleton-property-not-large]]。"}],"outgoing":["cc32a2c3b871a820"]}